"cloud/analysis/concord/configs/cuj/tasks/bigquery/bqUXR_Create_Dataset.yaml":"task:\n- id: bqUXR_Create_Dataset\n  group_label: prod\n  description: |-\n    CUJ task defined in slides:\n    https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1HO13CvCcrqnnEMWSXtv5E9vWRMJ11LlYLKgzIzHfck4/edit?resourcekey=0-2jYDyvwY-c3fSCASwnNP8A&slide=id.g33fd7bbeca1_2_61#slide=id.g33fd7bbeca1_2_61\n\n    Creating a dataset in BQ\n  product_name: BigQuery\n  implementation:\n  - name: new_implementation\n    signal:\n    - id: openCreateDatasetPanel\n      front_end_signal:\n        console_type: CLOUD_CONSOLE\n        page_path: /bigquery\n        client_event_signal:\n          event_type: bqDatasetCreate\n          event_name: openCreateDatasetSubtask\n      type: BEGIN\n      description: |-\n        Task begins when \u201ccreate dataset\u201d panel opens\n\n        Note there are multiple ingress points\n        Snowman menu in explorer panel\n        From dataset picker in Create Table flow.\n    - id: success\n      front_end_signal:\n        console_type: CLOUD_CONSOLE\n        page_path: /bigquery\n        client_event_signal:\n          event_type: bqDatasetCreate\n          event_name: submitSuccess\n      type: COMPLETE\n      description: 'Task is completed when user clicks create and the data successfully\n        creates. '\n    - id: cancel\n      front_end_signal:\n        console_type: CLOUD_CONSOLE\n        page_path: /bigquery\n        client_event_signal:\n          event_type: bqDatasetCreate\n          event_name: cancelCreateDatasetSubtask\n      type: TERMINATE\n      description: Task is terminated when user clicks cancel or clicks out of the\n        the panel, and the panel closes without having created a dataset.\n    - id: CreateDatasetError\n      front_end_signal:\n        console_type: CLOUD_CONSOLE\n        page_path: /bigquery\n        client_event_signal:\n          event_type: bqDatasetCreate\n          event_name: submitError\n      type: FAIL\n      description: Task fails if user clicks create and dataset is not created or\n        error is thrown by backend\n    begin_date: '2025-03-06'\n",
